sequenceDiagram
  actor O as Owner
  participant B as Order Board
  participant D as Order Details
  participant P as Pop-up
  participant L as Live Map
  participant S as Server
  O->>B: 1: Open the Orders tab
  B->>S: 2: GET /api/admin/orders?view=new
  O->>B: 3: Tap an order
  B->>D: 4: Open Order Details (timeline, address, phone)
  alt New order
    O->>D: 5: Tap Accept
    D->>P: 6: Choose the rider
    P->>S: 7: POST /api/admin/orders/accept
    S-->>D: 8: Processing, customer notified
  else Decline
    O->>D: 9: Tap Decline
    D->>P: 10: Choose or type the reason
    P->>S: 11: POST /api/admin/orders/{id}/decline
    S-->>B: 12: Declined, customer notified
  else Processing order
    O->>D: 13: Mark Out for Delivery
    D->>P: 14: Confirm (rider, gallons)
    P->>S: 15: POST /api/work/out
    S-->>D: 16: Out for Delivery, location sharing on
  else Out for Delivery or Not delivered
    O->>D: 17: Change rider, Mark paid, Re-deliver or Cancel
    D->>S: 18: POST /api/admin/orders/{id}/...
    S-->>D: 19: Updated, timeline step added
  end
  O->>B: 20: Tap Live Map
  B->>L: 21: Open Live Map (sidecar, route, deliveries running)
